        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-5617, Leaf and Berries Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Decorative Leaf Bow Pull gives the impression of the natural world with its subtle design. We especially like this pull because its design is so subtle, not drawing too much attention to the leaf design at the top. It is a great addition to any space. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. Made by RK International, this beautiful cabinet pull is available in 6 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/decorative-leaf-pull-backplate-rk-international-bp-7824\"><b>Decorative Leaf Cabinet Pull Backplate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/decorative-leaf-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-761\"><b>Decorative Leaf Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-5617 Deco-Leaf Bow Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
